  2. [1mEmit both keys[0m ([38;5;153muserId[39m and [38;5;153muser_id[39m) — non-breaking, lets consumers migrate, with a deprecation date for dropping
     [38;5;153muserId[39m.
  3. [1mVersioned endpoint[0m — what the README prescribes; [38;5;153m/v2/users[39m (or a version header) returns [38;5;153muser_id[39m, [38;5;153m/users[39m unchanged.

  I'd suggest 2 if you want consistency soon without coordinating three clients, or 3 if you want to follow the
